    "bookends": {
      "first": {
        "speaker": 1,
        "line": 2,
        "text": "I heard Magnum condoms are basically, essentially, basically the same size as regular condoms."
      },
      "last": {
        "speaker": 1,
        "line": 872,
        "text": "Lot of my friends were disappointed when they heard that. But I don’t know why. I think... it’s beautiful that people pray for each other, even though we all probably know, deep down, it doesn’t make a difference. It’s just nice to think about someone other than yourself."
      }
